Task 1

VA   = Virtual Address
PTE  = Page Table Entry
PA   = Physical Address
perm = Permission/flag bits

A page-table entry logically contains the physical page number that the
virtual page maps to, together with flags that specify how the page can be
accessed.

The relevant RISC-V PTE flags are:

V = Valid
R = Read
W = Write
X = Execute
U = User
G = Global
A = Accessed
D = Dirty


1. va 0x0

pte 0x21FC885B
